<title>USA: Semiconductor Packaging Q1 net decreases.</title>
<headline>Semiconductor Packaging Q1 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>For The Three Months   For The Three Months</p>
<p>				  Ended December	    Ended March</p>
<p>					   1996	 1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenue			$10,590,766 $13,906,865 $11,248,263</p>
<p>Income Before Minority</p>
<p>Interest in Loss of</p>
<p>  Consolidated Subsidiary     215,678     366,267     989,603</p>
<p>Minority Interest in</p>
