<p>NOTE:  Semiconductor Packaging Materials Co said earnings per share amounts assume full dilution.  Earnings per share have been computed on a weighted average number of common shares and common stock equivalents outstanding.</p>
<p>Company said the increase in revenue increase over the fourth quarter of 1996 was attributable to the inclusion of $2,301,000 of revenue from Silicon Materials Service, which was acquired in January 1997.</p>
